  "remarks": "JSC Upravlenie Otgruzok is a Russian company that is active in the energy sector and part of PJSC Slavneft. JSC Upravlenie Otgruzok provides oil transport and logistic services to PJSC Slavneft. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides a substantial source of revenues to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Upravlenie Otgruzok is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
